63520,ELE-OWI-MSK613,bhavesh2,Elenco 3-In-1 Solar Stallion,Elenco 3-In-1 Solar Stallion,0.200,26.950,0,," <EOL>* Triple your fun in the sun with 3- in-1 Solar Stallion.<br /> <EOL>* This solar-powered kit helps kids understand the benefits of renewable energy while creating their own fun, battery-free toy.<br /> <EOL>* It’s exciting to watch solar energy make the product come to life, and this hand-on approach to science and building creates a tangible lesson in solar energy for girls and boys alike.<br /> <EOL>* Young horse lovers will especially enjoy assembling and re-assembling these easy-to-build equine choices:  ‘Horse Trainer’, ‘Pegasus’, or ‘Chariot’.<br /> <EOL>* Not for children under 3 years<br /><br> <EOL><b>Specifications</b><br /> <EOL>* Solar Panel Output: 100mA<br /> <EOL>* Assembled Size: 172mm x 96mm x 235mm<br /> <EOL>* (Pegasus), 196mm x 75mm x 121mm (Chariot),<br /> <EOL>* 206mm x 52mm x 104mm (Horse Trainer)<br /> <EOL>* Unit Weight  : 121g<br /> <EOL>* Solar Cell Life: 2 yrs in normal use<br /> <EOL>* Motor: DC<br /> <EOL>* Power Consumption: 40mA<br /> <EOL>* Tool  needed: screw driver [(+) size m2-3]<br /> <EOL>* Piece count:  104",,10000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,12444,Elenco Electronics/Toy Division/Elenco Solar Kits,,18.060,,Thursday 27 January 2011 08:26:09 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,309,092087676131,13.500,0,N,43,"Elenco Electronics, Inc."
