62858,ELE-OWI-688,bhavesh2,Elenco Amphibious Solar Vehicle,Amphibious Solar Vehicle,0.200,54.950,0,," <EOL>* This kit introduces the fundamentals of solar power through hands-on experiments.<br /> <EOL>* The sun or any intense mobile light can power the solar battery (included). A multiple function switch (solar[1.4V, 350mA] or battery) allows this kit to be energized day or night, indoors or outdoors.<br /> <EOL>* The user can explore different types of energy and energy conversion with this land and water vehicle.<br /> <EOL>* Learn what materials solar batteries are made from and the characteristics of solar batteries, advantages, and disadvantages of solar power.<br /> <EOL>* Requires 1 ""AA"" Battery (part # 590001)<br> <EOL>* Not for Children under 3 years <EOL>",,0,0,N,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,52036,Discontinued Products,,50.400,,Friday 21 January 2011 10:04:04 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,309,,32.950,0,N,43,"Elenco Electronics, Inc."
62523,ELE-OWI-354,bhavesh2,Elenco Angelic Butterfly: Aluminum Kit,Elenco Angelic Butterfly: Aluminum Kit,0.200,12.500,0,," <EOL>* Almost lifelike, OWI’s aluminum insect building kit features a butterfly that you assemble from metal and bendable aluminum parts.<br /> <EOL>* Butterflies are interesting because of their unusual life cycle.<br /> <EOL>* The cycle starts with its larval caterpillar stage.<br /> <EOL>* It proceeds to its inactive pupal stage, and then transforms into its most recognizable adult form to a multi-colored winged flying insect.<br /> <EOL>* OWI’s Angelic Butterfly has diverse patterns of its own.<br /> <EOL>* Its beautiful metallic color has graced the attention of many butterfly watchers.<br /> <EOL>* Instead of watching, you get to build this masterpiece.<br /> <EOL>* It includes 22 hard and soft pre-punched aluminum parts, 4 screws, 4 nuts, and 4 springs with assembly tools included in the kit.<br /> <EOL>* Angelic Butterfly’s wings and legs are moveable for your creative pleasure.<br /> <EOL>* Not for Children under 3 years.",,0,0,N,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,52036,Discontinued Products,,11.960,,Thursday 20 January 2011 05:29:48 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,309,,7.500,0,N,43,"Elenco Electronics, Inc."
