62473,ELE-EDU-61002,bhavesh2,Elenco Leonardo da Vinci Kit: Aerial Screw,Elenco Leonardo da Vinci Kit: Aerial Screw,0.200,19.950,0,, <EOL>* The Aerial Screw designed by Leonardo da Vinci was a precursor of the modern day helicopter.<br /> <EOL>* The device was designed to compress air in order to obtain flight.<br /> <EOL>* The device uses a screw-shaped sail to drill in the air just as a screw drills into other materials.<br /> <EOL>* It consisted of a platform mounted by a helical screw driven by a rudimentary system similar to rubber band-powered model airplanes.<br /> <EOL>* The scientific genius of Leonardo da Vinci is brought to life through these 10 articulated models.<br /> <EOL>* The inventions that inspired these snap-together replicas are taken from the pages of Da Vinci’s priceless and awe-inspiring notebooks.<br /> <EOL>* All models are made of plastic and require no special tools.<br /> <EOL>* Manuals are very educational and teach how these inventions have evolved into what they are today.<br /> <EOL>* Not for Children under 3 years.,,10000,1,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,12447,Elenco Electronics/Toy Division/Leonardo da Vinci Kits,,13.420,,Wednesday 19 January 2011 10:27:25 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,309,769188610028,9.950,0,N,43,"Elenco Electronics, Inc."
62478,ELE-EDU-61006,bhavesh2,Elenco Leonardo da Vinci Kit: Armored Car,Elenco Leonardo da Vinci Kit: Armored Car,0.200,19.950,0,, <EOL>* Leonardo da Vinci's armored car was the precursor to the modern tanki ncorporated a turtle-shaped shell ringed with cannons.<br /> <EOL>* Inside eight men powered the tank by turning cranks.<br /> <EOL>* The sloped armor-plated roof kept the men safe by deflecting fire as they navigated through dangerous battles.<br /> <EOL>* The scientific genius of Leonardo da Vinci is brought to life through these 10 articulated models.<br /> <EOL>* The inventions that inspired these snap-together replicas are taken from the pages of Da Vinci’s priceless and awe-inspiring notebooks.<br /> <EOL>* All models are made of plastic and require no special tools.<br /> <EOL>* Manuals are very educational and teach how these inventions have evolved into what they are today.<br /> <EOL>* Not for Children under 3 years.,,10000,1,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,12447,Elenco Electronics/Toy Division/Leonardo da Vinci Kits,,13.420,,Wednesday 19 January 2011 10:38:34 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,309,769188610066,9.950,0,N,43,"Elenco Electronics, Inc."
62483,ELE-EDU-61010,bhavesh2,Elenco Leonardo da Vinci Kit: Bombard,Elenco Leonardo da Vinci Kit: Bombard,0.200,19.950,0,," <EOL>* To make the bombard or cannon more effective, Leonardo da Vinci designed projectiles that contained a quantity of mini gunpowder shots packed into petal-shaped iron pieces that formed a ball.<br /> <EOL>* After assembly, the cannonball was loaded into the barrel of the bombard and fired.<br /> <EOL>* The scientific genius of Leonardo da Vinci is brought to life through these 10 articulated models.<br /> <EOL>* The inventions that inspired these snap-together replicas are taken from the pages of Da Vinci’s priceless and awe-inspiring notebooks.<br /> <EOL>* All models are made of plastic and require no special tools.<br /> <EOL>* Manuals are very educational and teach how these inventions have evolved into what they are today.<br /> <EOL>* Not for Children under 3 years.",,10000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,12447,Elenco Electronics/Toy Division/Leonardo da Vinci Kits,,13.420,,Wednesday 19 January 2011 10:58:41 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,309,769188610103,9.950,0,N,43,"Elenco Electronics, Inc."
62482,ELE-EDU-61009,bhavesh2,Elenco Leonardo da Vinci Kit: Catapult,Elenco Leonardo da Vinci Kit: Catapult,0.200,19.950,0,, <EOL>* Leonardo da Vinci improved upon the already-established catapult design when he introduced his own vision the the age-old military launching device.<br /> <EOL>* This design uses a double leaf spring to produce a great deal of energy in order to propel stone projectiles or flammable materials over large distances.<br /> <EOL>* A hand crank on the side of the catapult was used to load the spring.<br /> <EOL>* The scientific genius of Leonardo da Vinci is brought to life through these 10 articulated models.<br /> <EOL>* The inventions that inspired these snap-together replicas are taken from the pages of Da Vinci’s priceless and awe-inspiring notebooks.<br /> <EOL>* All models are made of plastic and require no special tools.<br /> <EOL>* Manuals are very educational and teach how these inventions have evolved into what they are today.<br /> <EOL>* Not for Children under 3 years.,,10000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,12447,Elenco Electronics/Toy Division/Leonardo da Vinci Kits,,13.420,,Wednesday 19 January 2011 10:57:21 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,309,769188610097,9.950,0,N,43,"Elenco Electronics, Inc."
62471,ELE-EDU-61001,bhavesh2,Elenco Leonardo da Vinci Kit: Mechanical Drum,Elenco Leonardo da Vinci Kit: Mechanical Drum,0.200,19.950,0,, <EOL>* Leonardo da Vinci's Mechanical Drum is a cart equipped with an amply sized drum.<br /> <EOL>* When pulled or set in motion the gears turn the two lateral drums which are fitted with peg cams.<br /> <EOL>* These pegs move ten sticks (five on each side) that in turn beats the drum.<br /> <EOL>* The pegs could be placed in various positions to alter the rhythm of the music.<br /> <EOL>* The scientific genius of Leonardo da Vinci is brought to life through these 10 articulated models.<br /> <EOL>* The inventions that inspired these snap-together replicas are taken from the pages of da Vinci’s priceless and awe-inspiring notebooks.<br /> <EOL>* All models are made of plastic and require no special tools.<br /> <EOL>* Manuals are very educational and teach how these inventions have evolved into what they are today.<br /> <EOL>* Not for Children under 3 years.,,10000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,12447,Elenco Electronics/Toy Division/Leonardo da Vinci Kits,,13.420,,Wednesday 19 January 2011 10:22:52 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,309,769188610011,9.950,0,N,43,"Elenco Electronics, Inc."
62477,ELE-EDU-61005,bhavesh2,Elenco Leonardo da Vinci Kit: Multi-Barrel Cannon,Elenco Leonardo da Vinci Kit: Multi-Barrel Cannon,0.200,19.950,0,," <EOL>* Attempting to increase the firepower of a traditional cannon, Leonardo da Vinci designed the 12-barreled gun carriage in the fifteenth century.<br /> <EOL>* This cannon, which was designed to rest on a rolling cart, had a wider target area and also had the advantage of being able to be loaded at the same time it was firing.<br /> <EOL>* The scientific genius of Leonardo da Vinci is brought to life through these 10 articulated models.<br /> <EOL>* The inventions that inspired these snap-together replicas are taken from the pages of Da Vinci’s priceless and awe-inspiring notebooks.<br /> <EOL>* All models are made of plastic and require no special tools.<br /> <EOL>* Manuals are very educational and teach how these inventions have evolved into what they are today.<br /> <EOL>* Not for Children under 3 years.",,10000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,12447,Elenco Electronics/Toy Division/Leonardo da Vinci Kits,,13.420,,Wednesday 19 January 2011 10:36:57 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,309,769188610059,9.950,0,N,43,"Elenco Electronics, Inc."
62479,ELE-EDU-61007,bhavesh2,Elenco Leonardo da Vinci Kit: Paddleboat,Elenco Leonardo da Vinci Kit: Paddleboat,0.200,19.950,0,," <EOL>* In Leonardo da Vinci's time, nautical expedition was the most expedient method of communicating with the world.<br /> <EOL>* Da Vinci brought forth plans for a boat with large wheel-shaped paddles that would propel it through water.<br /> <EOL>* Da Vinci looked to nature when designing many of his inventions.<br /> <EOL>* He based the paddle boat on the shapes and movement of fish.<br /> <EOL>* The tapered prow allowed the vessel to maneuver easily.<br /> <EOL>* Sailors worked the pedals to turn the rotating paddles allowing the boat to move rapidly over water.<br /> <EOL>* The scientific genius of Leonardo da Vinci is brought to life through these 10 articulated models.<br /> <EOL>* The inventions that inspired these snap-together replicas are taken from the pages of Da Vinci’s priceless and awe-inspiring notebooks.<br /> <EOL>* All models are made of plastic and require no special tools.<br /> <EOL>* Manuals are very educational and teach how these inventions have evolved into what they are today.<br /> <EOL>* Not for Children under 3 years.",,10000,1,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,12447,Elenco Electronics/Toy Division/Leonardo da Vinci Kits,,13.420,,Wednesday 19 January 2011 10:40:05 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,309,769188610073,9.950,0,N,43,"Elenco Electronics, Inc."
62476,ELE-EDU-61004,bhavesh2,Elenco Leonardo da Vinci Kit: Printing Press,Elenco Leonardo da Vinci Kit: Printing Press,0.200,19.950,0,," <EOL>* Leonardo da Vinci studied the Guttenberg printing press and finely-tuned it for greater efficiency.<br /> <EOL>* In his design , da Vinci used a handpress with an automatic system that moved the type-saddle forward and back along a tilted surface.<br /> <EOL>* His press used a double thread which would increase the travel of the press for each turn made of the lever.<br /> <EOL>* The scientific genius of Leonardo da Vinci is brought to life through these 10 articulated models.<br /> <EOL>* The inventions that inspired these snap-together replicas are taken from the pages of Da Vinci’s priceless and awe-inspiring notebooks.<br /> <EOL>* All models are made of plastic and require no special tools.<br /> <EOL>* Manuals are very educational and teach how these inventions have evolved into what they are today.<br /> <EOL>* Not for Children under 3 years.",,10000,1,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,12447,Elenco Electronics/Toy Division/Leonardo da Vinci Kits,,13.420,,Wednesday 19 January 2011 10:34:44 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,309,769188610042,9.950,0,N,43,"Elenco Electronics, Inc."
62481,ELE-EDU-61008,bhavesh2,Elenco Leonardo da Vinci Kit: Self-Propelled Cart,Elenco Leonardo da Vinci Kit: Self-Propelled Cart,0.200,19.950,0,, <EOL>* Leonardo da Vinci designed the first self-propelled cart capable of moving without being pushed or pulled manually.<br /> <EOL>* The precursor to the modern automobile was most likely used during stage performances.<br /> <EOL>* It has three wheels and a steering column.<br /> <EOL>* The device moves via spring-loaded cams near the wheels.<br /> <EOL>* As the springs uncoil the stored power is transferred to the driving wheels using a set of gears.<br /> <EOL>* The scientific genius of Leonardo da Vinci is brought to life through these 10 articulated models.<br /> <EOL>* The inventions that inspired these snap-together replicas are taken from the pages of Da Vinci’s priceless and awe-inspiring notebooks.<br /> <EOL>* All models are made of plastic and require no special tools.<br /> <EOL>* Manuals are very educational and teach how these inventions have evolved into what they are today.<br /> <EOL>* Not for Children under 3 years.,,10000,1,Y,1.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,12447,Elenco Electronics/Toy Division/Leonardo da Vinci Kits,,13.420,,Wednesday 19 January 2011 10:56:01 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,309,769188610080,9.950,0,N,43,"Elenco Electronics, Inc."
62475,ELE-EDU-61003,bhavesh2,Elenco Leonardo da Vinci Kit: Swing Bridge,Elenco Leonardo da Vinci Kit: Swing Bridge,0.200,19.950,0,," <EOL>* Leonardo da Vinci's Swing Bridge design is a portable, lightweight bridge that was intended to span across a body of water so armies could cross and then quickly disassemble and tow away.<br /> <EOL>* By means of an articulated system of winches and wheels, the bridge was designed to rotate 90 degrees.<br /> <EOL>* ..<br /> <EOL>* The scientific genius of Leonardo da Vinci is brought to life through these 10 articulated models.<br /> <EOL>* The inventions that inspired these snap-together replicas are taken from the pages of Da Vinci’s priceless and awe-inspiring notebooks.<br /> <EOL>* All models are made of plastic and require no special tools.<br /> <EOL>* Manuals are very educational and teach how these inventions have evolved into what they are today.<br /> <EOL>* Not for Children under 3 years.",,10000,1,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,12447,Elenco Electronics/Toy Division/Leonardo da Vinci Kits,,13.420,,Wednesday 19 January 2011 10:31:09 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,309,769188610035,9.950,0,N,43,"Elenco Electronics, Inc."
