62025,ELE-EDU-37307,bhavesh2,Elenco Simulated Frog Dissection Kit,Elenco Simulated Frog Dissection Kit,0.200,49.950,0,," <EOL>* Get an Internal Close-Up with this Simulated Dissection Kit As authentic as you can get without working on a real frog, this kit offers the chance to practice biology without harming animals.<br /> <EOL>* Simulated dissection kit has removable, soft texture tissue that folds back to reveal a complete set of faux organs.<br /> <EOL>* A cross section shows intricate muscle structure.<br /> <EOL>* Kit includes X-ray film, dissecting tray, child-safe tools (scalpel, tweezers and prod), and magnifying glass.<br /><BR> <EOL><b>Warning:</b><BR> <EOL>* Not for Children under 3 years.",,1000000,1,N,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,52036,Discontinued Products,,32.310,,Monday 17 January 2011 05:12:25 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,309,769188373077,24.950,0,N,43,"Elenco Electronics, Inc."
64655,ELE-GF-800/555,anwar,Elenco Sine/Square Wave Audio Generator,Elenco Sine/Square Wave Audio Generator,1,74.950,0,," <EOL>* Sine and square wave generator<br /> <EOL>* Variable output control<br /> <EOL>* 20Hz to 150kHz in 46 steps<br /> <EOL>* Low battery indicator<br /> <EOL>* Low distortion R-C oscillator<br /> <EOL>* Compact portable, light weight<br /><br /> <EOL><b>Specifications:</b><br /> <EOL>* Frequency Range: x1 range 20Hz to 1.5kHz (23 steps), x100 range 2kHz to 150kHz (23 steps)<br /> <EOL>* Accuracy: 20Hz through 100kHz (±3% or less), 120kHz and 150kHz (±5% or less)<br /> <EOL>* Output Control: 0dB/-20dB attenuator switch and variable amplitude control<br /> <EOL>* Output Impedance: approximately 600Ω<br /> <EOL><b>Sinewave Characteristics:</b><br /> <EOL>* Output Voltage: ≥1.2V rms at max.<br /> <EOL>* setting (no load)<br /> <EOL>* Output Flatness: (short term) 20Hz to 150kHz +0.5dB (reference frequency 1kHz)<br /> <EOL>* Distortion: 200HHz - 15kHz <0.05% 15kHz-150kHz <0.3<br /> <EOL><b>Square Wave Characteristics:</b><br /> <EOL>* Output Voltage: ≥5V p-p at maximum setting<br /> <EOL>* Rise & Fall Time: Less than 0.5µs<br /> <EOL>* Sag: Less than 5% at 20Hz (DC coupled)<br /> <EOL>* Over Shoot: <2% from maximum output, to 50mV p-p<br /> <EOL>* Duty Ratio: 50%±5%<br /> <EOL><b>Synchronization Characteristics:</b><br /> <EOL>* Output Voltage: ≥1.2rms (no load)<br /> <EOL>* Output Impedance: 1kΩ ±5%<br /> <EOL>* Other specifications same as sinewave characteristics",,10000,2,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,12409,Elenco Electronics/Electronics Division/Generators & Counters,,64.680,,Friday 11 February 2011 08:43:24 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,309,,49.950,0,N,43,"Elenco Electronics, Inc."
