64652,ELE-FG-600K,anwar,Elenco Surface Mount Generator Kit,Elenco Surface Mount Generator Kit,1,44.950,0,," <EOL>* These versatile function generators include surface mount components such as IC's, resistors and capacitors.<br /> <EOL>* When completed, they provide Sine, Square and Sawtooth waveforms, continuously variable to 1MHz. Amplitude adjustable.<br /> <EOL>* Complete with all parts and PC board.<br /> <EOL>* Both include case and extensive training manual<br /> <EOL>* Requires 1 9V battery (part # 590009)<br /><br /> <EOL><b>Specifications</b><br /> <EOL>* Waveforms: Sine, Square, Triangle.<br /> <EOL>* Frequency: 0.1-1MHz.<br /> <EOL>* Impedance: 600Ώ±10%.<br /> <EOL>* Amplitude: Sine/Triangle: 0-3V at 9VDC input.<br /> <EOL>* Squarewave: 0.5-9V (no load).<br /> <EOL>* Frequency Variable Range: 100:1 or more.<br /> <EOL>* Frequency Multimeter: x1, x10, x100.<br /> <EOL><b>Sine Wave:</b><br /> <EOL>* Distortion: Less than 1%.<br /> <EOL>* Flatness: ±0.5 dB 1Hz-100kHz.<br /> <EOL>* Temperature Stability: ±20ppm/°C Typical.<br /> <EOL><b>Square Wave:</b><br /> <EOL>* Symmetry: Less than 5% (at 1kHz).<br /> <EOL>* Rise & Fall Time: Less than 300ns (at 1kHz).<br /> <EOL><b>Triangle Wave:</b><br /> <EOL>* Linearity: Less than 1% (up to 100kHz).<br /> <EOL>* Power Requirements: 9 to 18VDC at input.",,10000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,12431,Elenco Electronics/Electronics Division/Electronic Kits/Deluxe Electronic Kits,,34.900,,Friday 11 February 2011 08:36:47 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,309,,26.950,0,N,43,"Elenco Electronics, Inc."
