63496,ELE-UC-90,bhavesh2,Elenco Upgrade Kit for SC-ROV10 to SC-ROV50,Elenco Upgrade Kit for SC-ROV10 to SC-ROV50,0.200,45.950,0,," <EOL>* The UC90 Disc Launcher and Sound Recording Device for the Snap Circuits RC Rover is now available.<br /> <EOL>* This upgrade for existing RC Rover owners allows you to record space sounds and voices on your Sound and Recording Module.<br /> <EOL>* The Sound and Recording feature allows you to adjust and modify a variety of sounds using different resistor and capacitor values.<br /> <EOL>* You can change pitch and frequency and make recordings of your own voice for up to 12 seconds.<br /> <EOL>* This upgrade allows you to vary and control the brightness of the LEDs.<br /> <EOL>* You can build a metronome and adjust the click rate to sound like a musical beat or a continuous tone.<br /> <EOL>* You can also make the lights and tone blink and sound in unison and make your Rover sound like a car alarm going off.<br /> <EOL>* The disc launcher snaps onto your Rover and will carry 15 foam discs that fire from the launcher.<br /> <EOL>* The disc launcher has a set of beady red eyes that light and flash when the launcher is engaged by the touch of a button on the remote control hand set.<br /> <EOL>* Press the button again and the launcher starts shooting its discs.<br /> <EOL>* The upgrade allows you to build a double launcher using a capacitor that simulates a longer hold on the launch button, shooting two discs instead of one.<br /> <EOL>* The Martian Monster and Venus Visitor are just two of the 63 Projects the UC90 upgrade includes.<br /> <EOL>* Not for children under 3 years",,10000,3,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,12397,Elenco Electronics/Electronics Division/Elenco Snap Circuits/Elenco Snap Circuits: Upgrade Kits,,29.720,,Thursday 27 January 2011 07:43:05 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,309,756619006680,22.950,0,N,43,"Elenco Electronics, Inc."
