62806,ELE-OWI-MSK677,bhavesh2,Flapping Sea Gull,Flapping Sea Gull ,0.200,18.950,0,," <EOL>* Squawk, Squawk, Squaaaawk!<br /> <EOL>* OWI’s  Flapping Sea Gull mini solar kit will provide an adventure marked by growth in self-confidence and self-esteem.<br /> <EOL>* As the builder embarks on creating a kit that looks similar to a sea gull, one will sense a minute by minute attitude change.<br /> <EOL>* What first started out to be a box full of parts with a set of instructions has turned out to be a life like creation of a three dimensional wing flapping masterpiece.<br /> <EOL>* The Flapping Sea Gull loves the smell of the ocean breeze, but will require the warmth of the sun in order to flap it wings.<br /> <EOL>* It’s just another of OWI’s way to teach alternative energy principles.<br /> <EOL>* The suction cup will allow you to secure your new friend in direct sunlight and watch it be your weather indicator.<br /> <EOL>* Sea Gull poop clean up not required.<br /> <EOL>* No batteries and tools required and only 12 plastic parts to assemble.<br /> <EOL>* Not for children under 3 years<br /> <EOL>* No Batteries Required<br /><br> <EOL><b>Specifications</b><br> <EOL>* Solar Panel Output: 1.1V x 50mA<br> <EOL>* Assembled Size: 170mm x 80mm x 19mm<br> <EOL>* Unit Weight: 1.6 oz<br> <EOL>* Solar Cell Life: 2 yrs in normal use<br> <EOL>* Motor: DC<br> <EOL>* Power Consumption: 1.2V x 10mA<br> <EOL>* Tool  needed: diagonal cutter; scissors",,0,0,N,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,12444,Elenco Electronics/Toy Division/Elenco Solar Kits,,12.810,,Friday 21 January 2011 07:52:59 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,309,092087676773,9.500,0,N,43,"Elenco Electronics, Inc."
62776,ELE-OWI-MSK670,bhavesh2,Frightened Grasshopper Kit,Frightened Grasshopper Kit,0.200,14.950,0,," <EOL>* Eyes jiggle, legs wiggle, and antennas sway to-and-fro is the combo tango-jitterbug-frightened-grasshopper dance.<br /> <EOL>* It is unmistakably an attention-grabber.<br /> <EOL>* Pint-sized and power to pack a punch, this enticingly amusing solar bug will surely capture your heart.<br /> <EOL>* Turn on its power switch (the sun) and you will smile like there is no tomorrow.<br /> <EOL>* This frolicking fancy is easy to assemble and demonstrates an alternative energy principle.<br /> <EOL>* No batteries and tools required and less than ten parts to snap together.<br /> <EOL>* No Batteries Required <br> <EOL>* Not for children under 3 years<br><br> <EOL><b>Specifications</b><br> <EOL>* Solar Panel Output : 1.1V x 50mA<br> <EOL>* Assembled Size: 49mm x 26.8mm x 15.7mm<br> <EOL>* Unit Weight: 5.5 g<br> <EOL>* Solar Cell Life: 2 yrs in normal use<br> <EOL>* Motor: DC<br> <EOL>* Power Consumption  : 1.2V x 10mA",,10000,2,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,12444,Elenco Electronics/Toy Division/Elenco Solar Kits,,10.190,,Friday 21 January 2011 07:11:42 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,309,092087676704,7.500,0,N,43,"Elenco Electronics, Inc."
64537,ELE-C-170,anwar,General Purpose Tool Pouch,General Purpose Tool Pouch,0.500,13.250,0,," <EOL>* Ideal for electricians and maintenance people.<br /> <EOL>* Made from heavy-duty, green canvas material with adjustable quick release belt.<br /> <EOL>* Pouch 11"" x 10"" with multiple pockets.",,10000,1,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,12401,Elenco Electronics/Electronics Division/Cases & Holsters,,10.720,,Thursday 10 February 2011 08:21:37 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,309,,7.950,0,N,43,"Elenco Electronics, Inc."
64569,ELE-WJL-6000,anwar,Halogen Leak Detector,Halogen Leak Detector,1,49.950,0,," <EOL>* Detects all kinds of halogen refrigerants<br /> <EOL>* Sensitivity adjusted at any time and it can be adjusted automatically to the best state of detecting.<br /> <EOL>* Audible and visual leak indicators<br /> <EOL>* Inner precise IC with Ultra-low consume circuit design, more stable, longer battery life.<br /> <EOL>* Tri-color visual display of battery voltage.<br /> <EOL>* Excellent sensor, high sensitivity, longer use.<br /> <EOL>* Storage pouch included",,10002,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,12402,Elenco Electronics/Electronics Division/Clamp Meters & Leak Detectors,,38.790,,Thursday 10 February 2011 10:06:58 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,309,,29.950,0,N,43,"Elenco Electronics, Inc."
