62801,ELE-OWI-MSK675,bhavesh2,Peppy Orangutan Kit,Peppy Orangutan Kit,0.200,21.950,0,," <EOL>* The award winning Jungle Robot would like to introduce you to its environmentally friendly cousin, PEPPY Orangutan.<br /> <EOL>* Always introducing unique products, OWI has outdone itself with a brand new mysterious solar kit that traverses across ropes, hand-over-hand like a monkey.<br /> <EOL>* Amaze and surprise your friends with its animal-like animation.<br /> <EOL>* No batteries required and only 15 plastic parts to assemble.<br /> <EOL>* Clear easy to follow instructions.<br /> <EOL>* PEPPY Orangutan can motivate students to learn about micro-robotics and solar energy.<br /> <EOL>* It also teaches students to follow precise visual diagrams.<br /> <EOL>* Not for children under 3 years<br /> <EOL>* No Batteries Required<br /><br> <EOL><b>Specifications</b><br> <EOL>* Solar Panel Output: 1.1V x 50mA<br> <EOL>* Assembled Size: 80mm x 55mm x 40mm <br> <EOL>* Solar Cell Life: 2 yrs in normal use<br> <EOL>* Motor: DC<br> <EOL>* Power Consumption: 1.2V x 10mA<br> <EOL>* Tool  needed: diagonal cutter; screwdriver",,0,0,N,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,12444,Elenco Electronics/Toy Division/Elenco Solar Kits,,14.760,,Friday 21 January 2011 07:42:37 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,309,092087676759,10.950,0,N,43,"Elenco Electronics, Inc."
