63305,ELE-EDU-8350,bhavesh2,Power Tech Series Kit: Super Chem,Power Tech Series Kit: Super Chem,0.200,35.950,0,," <EOL>* 100 kitchen activities in chemistry include balloon trick, gas cannon, making a geyser, cleaning old coins, cola volcano, removing an egg’s shell without touching it, making soap bubble solution, making invisible ink, making cheese, potato stamp, finding iron in cereal, and many more!<br /> <EOL>* Not for children under 3 years<br /> <EOL>* Adult supervision required<br /> <EOL>* Keep uninflated balloons from children<br /> <EOL>* Discard broken balloons at once",,10000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,14564,Elenco Electronics/Electronics Division/Power Tech Series Kits,,23.630,,Tuesday 25 January 2011 07:43:08 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,309,756619006079,17.950,0,N,43,"Elenco Electronics, Inc."
63308,ELE-EDU-8355,bhavesh2,Power Tech Series Kit: Super Chem 120,Power Tech Series Kit: Super Chem 120,0.200,39.950,0,," <EOL>* SUPER CHEM, 120 activities with fun science and kitchen chemistry.<br /> <EOL>* Make giant soap bubbles and three dimensional soap bubble sculptures.<br /> <EOL>* Make monster dough, grow crystals, create secret writing.<br /> <EOL>* Prepare your own fun shaped soap, a volcano and a propelled motor boat.<br /> <EOL>* Observe the way plants react to chemicals and light.<br /> <EOL>* A full colored simple to read instructions manual is included in this kit.<br /> <EOL>* Not for children under 3 years<br /> <EOL>* Adult supervision required<br /> <EOL>* Keep uninflated balloons from children<br /> <EOL>* Discard broken balloons at once",,10000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,14564,Elenco Electronics/Electronics Division/Power Tech Series Kits,,26.050,,Tuesday 25 January 2011 07:47:17 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,309,756619006086,19.950,0,N,43,"Elenco Electronics, Inc."
