63058,ELE-EDU-7050,bhavesh2,Science Lab Kit: Dynamics,Science Lab Kit: Dynamics,0.200,23.950,0,," <EOL>* Full color, easy-to-read instruction manual with graphic illustrations.<br /> <EOL>* This kit contains over 45 activities such as building a fan, making a yo-yo, and making a hydrometer while exploring the principles of gravity, inertia, mechanics, friction, and surface tension.<br /> <EOL>* Not for Children under 3 years",,0,0,N,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,52036,Discontinued Products,,18.690,,Saturday 22 January 2011 08:43:56 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,309,,11.950,0,N,43,"Elenco Electronics, Inc."
