63028,ELE-EDU-3020,bhavesh2,Science Lab Kit: Lemon Clock,Science Lab Kit: Lemon Clock,0.200,14.950,0,," <EOL>* Make your own digital clock using nature’s electricity.<br /> <EOL>* The kit includes over 18experiments including LED’s, chemical reactions, electro-chemistry, electro-magnetism, acid/base substances, and invisible inks.",,10000,3,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,14563,Elenco Electronics/Electronics Division/Science Lab Kits,,10.190,,Saturday 22 January 2011 07:50:12 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,309,756619005805,7.500,0,N,43,"Elenco Electronics, Inc."
63076,ELE-EDU-7082,bhavesh2,Science Lab Kit: Magnets,Science Lab Kit: Magnets,0.200,23.950,0,," <EOL>* MAGNETS, a fun magnet kit for all the family from age 6+. Amaze your friends with a variety of magnetic tricks, create faces and make an electromagnet.<br /> <EOL>* See and feel magnetic forces, make a compass and play magnetic football and billiards.<br /> <EOL>* Not for children under 3 years",,0,0,N,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,52036,Discontinued Products,,18.690,,Saturday 22 January 2011 09:55:22 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,309,,0,0,N,43,"Elenco Electronics, Inc."
63077,ELE-EDU-7086,bhavesh2,Science Lab Kit: My Senses,Science Lab Kit: My Senses,0.200,39.950,0,," <EOL>* This kit is part of our Body Awareness Science Series, exploring the five senses: sight, hearing, smell, taste, and touch.<br /> <EOL>* Perform over 50 fascinating experiments.<br /> <EOL>* Use a genuine stethoscope, make a telescope with real lenses and create rainbows with a prism.<br /> <EOL>* Prepare perfume and stink bombs with chemistry lab equipment.<br /> <EOL>* Learn how to read and send messages in Braille.<br /> <EOL>* Also includes many activities suitable for party games.",,10000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,14563,Elenco Electronics/Electronics Division/Science Lab Kits,,26.050,,Saturday 22 January 2011 09:59:14 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,309,756619006017,19.950,0,N,43,"Elenco Electronics, Inc."
