63033,ELE-EDU-3070,bhavesh2,Science Lab Kit: Water Clock,Science Lab Kit: Water Clock,0.200,14.950,0,," <EOL>* WATER CLOCK, make a clock that can work just on tap water!<br /> <EOL>* You will never needed batteries again!<br /> <EOL>* Also works on a variety of household materials such as: cola, fruit juice and even ketchup!<br /> <EOL>* Try other materials and see how the clock never stops.<br /> <EOL>* This is the best timekeeper you will ever have<br /> <EOL>* Not for children under 3 years",,10000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,14563,Elenco Electronics/Electronics Division/Science Lab Kits,,16.720,,Saturday 22 January 2011 08:00:48 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,309,756619005843,12.500,0,N,43,"Elenco Electronics, Inc."
